{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"sed -n '1,220p' ../input/TASK.md && sed -n '1,260p' ../input/seed.population.json && sed -n '1,320p' ../model.orm.yaml && shasum -a 256 ../input/TASK.md ../input/seed.population.json ../model.orm.yaml && wc -c ../input/TASK.md ../input/seed.population.json ../model.orm.yaml\"","aggregated_output":"# Task\n\nAda liked the look of `night` and asked for it. Recommend books for Ada,\nincluding `night`.\n\nWrite `recommendation.population.json` in the current directory (the candidate\ndirectory): a copy of `../input/seed.population.json` whose `recommendation`\nlist contains at least two books for `ada`. Keep every other fact list and the\n`population` header exactly as they are. The rules are in `../model.orm.yaml`;\nthe books, genres, ratings and reader preferences are in the seed facts.\n\nIf you can run commands, check your file with\n`gnd check ../model.orm.yaml recommendation.population.json` and fix it until\nthe check exits 0. Edit nothing outside the candidate directory.\n{\n  \"population\": {\n    \"model\": \"model.orm.yaml\",\n    \"model_id\": \"urn:gnd-tutorial:bookrec\",\n    \"source\": \"synthetic\",\n    \"covers\": [\n      \"recommendation\",\n      \"user_rated_book\",\n      \"user_is_minor\",\n      \"book_rated_adult\",\n      \"book_has_genre\",\n      \"user_prefers_genre\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"facts\": {\n    \"recommendation\": [\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ada\",\n        \"book\": \"map\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ben\",\n        \"book\": \"night\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"user_rated_book\": [\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ada\",\n        \"book\": \"read\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ben\",\n        \"book\": \"read\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"user_is_minor\": [\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ada\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"book_rated_adult\": [\n      {\n        \"book\": \"night\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"book_has_genre\": [\n      {\n        \"book\": \"cosmos\",\n        \"genre\": \"science\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"book\": \"map\",\n        \"genre\": \"fantasy\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"book\": \"night\",\n        \"genre\": \"fantasy\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"book\": \"read\",\n        \"genre\": \"fantasy\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"book\": \"river\",\n        \"genre\": \"fantasy\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"user_prefers_genre\": [\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ada\",\n        \"genre\": \"fantasy\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"user\": \"ben\",\n        \"genre\": \"fantasy\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"model_id\": \"urn:gnd-tutorial:bookrec\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"kind\": \"text-conversation\",\n    \"confidence\": \"standard\",\n    \"mode\": \"one-shot\"\n  },\n  \"object_types\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"user\",\n      \"name\": \"User\",\n      \"kind\": \"entity\",\n      \"reference\": {\n        \"mode\": \"popular\",\n        \"value_type\": \"user_id\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"user_id\",\n      \"name\": \"UserId\",\n      \"kind\": \"value\",\n      \"primitive\": \"String\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"book\",\n      \"name\": \"Book\",\n      \"kind\": \"entity\",\n      \"reference\": {\n        \"mode\": \"popular\",\n        \"value_type\": \"book_id\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"book_id\",\n      \"name\": \"BookId\",\n      \"kind\": \"value\",\n      \"primitive\": \"String\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"genre\",\n      \"name\": \"Genre\",\n      \"kind\": \"value\",\n      \"primitive\": \"String\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"fact_types\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"recommendation\",\n      \"reading\": \"{User} is recommended {Book}\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"user\",\n          \"role_name\": \"user\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"book\",\n          \"role_name\": \"book\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"user_rated_book\",\n      \"reading\": \"{User} rated {Book}\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"user\",\n          \"role_name\": \"user\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"book\",\n          \"role_name\": \"book\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"user_is_minor\",\n      \"reading\": \"{User} is a minor\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"user\",\n          \"role_name\": \"user\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"book_rated_adult\",\n      \"reading\": \"{Book} is adult-rated\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"book\",\n          \"role_name\": \"book\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"book_has_genre\",\n      \"reading\": \"{Book} has primary genre {Genre}\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"book\",\n          \"role_name\": \"book\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"genre\",\n          \"role_name\": \"genre\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"constraints\": [\n        {\n          \"type\": \"uniqueness\",\n          \"source\": \"explicit\",\n          \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n          \"modality\": \"alethic\",\n          \"provenance\": {\n            \"user_quote\": \"Each book has exactly one primary genre.\"\n          },\n          \"roles\": [\n            \"book\"\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"type\": \"mandatory\",\n          \"source\": \"explicit\",\n          \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n          \"modality\": \"alethic\",\n          \"provenance\": {\n            \"user_quote\": \"Each book has exactly one primary genre.\"\n          },\n          \"role\": \"book\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"user_prefers_genre\",\n      \"reading\": \"{User} prefers {Genre}\",\n      \"roles\": [\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"user\",\n          \"role_name\": \"user\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"object_type\": \"genre\",\n          \"role_name\": \"genre\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"constraints\": [\n    {\n      \"type\": \"guarded\",\n      \"source\": \"explicit\",\n      \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"modality\": \"alethic\",\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"user_quote\": \"Never recommend a book the user has already rated.\"\n      },\n      \"id\": \"unread_only\",\n      \"antecedent\": [\n        {\n          \"fact_type\": \"recommendation\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"user\": \"$u\",\n            \"book\": \"$b\"\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"consequent\": {\n        \"absence\": {\n          \"fact_type\": \"user_rated_book\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"user\": \"$u\",\n            \"book\": \"$b\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"guarded\",\n      \"source\": \"explicit\",\n      \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"modality\": \"alethic\",\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"user_quote\": \"Never recommend an adult-rated book to a minor.\"\n      },\n      \"id\": \"age_appropriate\",\n      \"antecedent\": [\n        {\n          \"fact_type\": \"recommendation\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"user\": \"$u\",\n            \"book\": \"$b\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"fact_type\": \"user_is_minor\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"user\": \"$u\"\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"consequent\": {\n        \"absence\": {\n          \"fact_type\": \"book_rated_adult\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"book\": \"$b\"\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"guarded\",\n      \"source\": \"explicit\",\n      \"status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"modality\": \"deontic\",\n      \"provenance\": {\n        \"user_quote\": \"A recommendation should match a preferred genre.\"\n      },\n      \"id\": \"preferred_genre\",\n      \"antecedent\": [\n        {\n          \"fact_type\": \"recommendation\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"user\": \"$u\",\n            \"book\": \"$b\"\n          }\n        },\n        {\n          \"fact_type\": \"book_has_genre\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"book\": \"$b\",\n            \"genre\": \"$g\"\n          }\n        }\n      ],\n      \"consequent\": {\n        \"atom\": {\n          \"fact_type\": \"user_prefers_genre\",\n          \"bind\": {\n            \"user\": \"$u\",\n            \"genre\": \"$g\"\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"rationale\": \"The tutorial brief explicitly says should; genre fit is advisory in the first release.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\nb1d54631c8c1acf76b4c33d0dd28cc5536f92d0669a10d075894b4da90730d82  ../input/TASK.md\nbe1f8cbc9b0150d3263806b11a5a02b62e6e96f1433ec35aedc1f02779976ab9  ../input/seed.population.json\n0198fcfbeca7f006c581915ae456f788c762ab3cb697a01c06535188a658656c  ../model.orm.yaml\n     678 ../input/TASK.md\n    1311 ../input/seed.population.json\n    5247 ../model.orm.yaml\n    7236 total\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
